# 换行与二进制规则
# 工程有一条硬判据：所有 .java 必须是 LF（CRLF 会变红）。这里钉死，避免在不同平台上 clone 后被自动转换。

* text=auto eol=lf

*.java   text eol=lf
*.py     text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.xml    text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.yml    text eol=lf
*.mjs    text eol=lf
*.js     text eol=lf
*.cpp    text eol=lf
*.txt    text eol=lf

*.bat    text eol=crlf
*.cmd    text eol=crlf

*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.webp   binary
*.gif    binary
*.so     binary
*.jar    binary
*.onnx   binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.tgz    binary
